---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../../../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../../../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import SwrFittingRateTable from '../../../components/SwrFittingRateTable.astro';
import { swrRingFitRemainingFittings } from '../../../data/swrRingFitRemainingFittings';
const catalogueUrl = '/catalogue/flowin-price-list-2026.pdf#page=11';
---
<BaseLayout title="SWR ring-fit fittings | Flowin Pipes & Fittings" description="Flowin SWR ring-fit tee, reducer, cleansing-pipe and rubber-ring sizes, box packing and rates from the 2026 catalogue.">
  <SiteHeader /><main>
    <div class="wrap product-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><a href="/products/swr/">SWR drainage</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">More ring-fit fittings</span></div>
    <section class="wrap product-hero" aria-labelledby="family-title"><div class="product-hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow">SWR drainage / ring fit</span><h1 id="family-title">More ring-fit<br />fittings.</h1><p class="product-lead">Browse the remaining verified ring-fit tee, reducer, cleansing-pipe and rubber-ring entries from Flowin’s 2026 catalogue.</p><p class="product-standard">Catalogue section: <strong>SWR FITTING (RING FIT)</strong>. Each printed fitting table stays separate so its size, box packing and rate remain clear.</p><div class="product-actions"><a class="solid-btn" href="#sizes">View sizes &amp; rates <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a><a class="text-link" href={catalogueUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">See catalogue page 11 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div>
      <figure class="product-visual"><svg viewBox="0 0 500 500" role="img" aria-label="Simple line illustration of assorted ring-fit fittings"><defs><linearGradient id="accessory-body" x2="1" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#fff" /><stop offset="1" stop-color="#c7c9c5" /></linearGradient></defs><path d="M93 99h88v88h75v87h-75v122H93V274H26v-87h67zM302 78h110v110h54v96h-54v118H302V284h-70v-96h70z" fill="url(#accessory-body)" stroke="#91958f" stroke-width="3"/><ellipse cx="137" cy="99" rx="44" ry="14" fill="#d8dbd6" stroke="#91958f" stroke-width="3"/><ellipse cx="137" cy="99" rx="32" ry="8" fill="#636963"/><ellipse cx="357" cy="78" rx="55" ry="17" fill="#d8dbd6" stroke="#91958f" stroke-width="3"/><ellipse cx="357" cy="78" rx="41" ry="10" fill="#636963"/><path d="M103 106c14 10 50 10 68 0M314 85c17 12 63 12 86 0M26 230h55M412 235h54" stroke="#c64d18" stroke-width="5"/></svg><figcaption>Illustrative fitting diagram; not a product photograph.</figcaption></figure>
    </section>
    <section class="product-data" id="sizes" aria-labelledby="sizes-title"><div class="wrap"><div class="product-data-intro"><span class="eyebrow">Catalogue details</span><h2 id="sizes-title">Fittings, box packing<br />and rates.</h2><p>All remaining ring-fit fitting tables from page 11 are shown separately. The PDF’s “=” decimal marks are displayed as points; no currency is inferred.</p></div><div class="variant-grid">{swrRingFitRemainingFittings.map((variant, index) => <SwrFittingRateTable variant={variant} number={String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')} />)}</div><div class="source-band"><p>Source: Flowin Price list 2026, PDF page 11. Rates are per piece and packing is per box. The original catalogue is definitive.</p><a href={catalogueUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open original tables ↗</a></div></div></section>
    <section class="wrap family-outro" aria-labelledby="family-outro-title"><div><span class="eyebrow">Another SWR system</span><h2 id="family-outro-title">Need self-fit<br />instead?</h2></div><div><p>Self-fit pipes are available separately. Its fitting catalogue pages remain the next review batch.</p><a class="solid-btn" href="/products/swr/self-fit-pipes/">View self-fit pipes <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
  </main><SiteFooter />
</BaseLayout>
